&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fospha is the measurement system enterprise retail and ecommerce brands run their business on. We give marketing teams one clear, daily view of what&#39;s actually working — across every channel and everywhere they sell, from their website to Amazon and TikTok Shop — down to the level of a single ad or piece of creative. It replaces guesswork and gut feel with a number marketing, finance and agencies can all trust and act on. Brands including Dyson, Gymshark, Lululemon and many more use Fospha up to 25 times a day to decide where budget should move next. We&#39;ve spent over a decade building this, with more than $40 billion in marketing spend now optimised through the platform - and we&#39;re scaling fast across London, Mumbai and Austin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Graduate Opportunity at Fospha&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Fospha’s graduate programme means stepping into a fast-paced environment where you’ll gain real responsibility and exposure from day one. In Partnerships, graduates work directly with some of the world’s biggest digital platforms - like TikTok, Meta, and Snapchat - playing a key role in strengthening relationships, enabling joint initiatives, and driving partner success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on exposure to our Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Working directly with the platforms such as Tiktok, Meta and Snap, you will build commercial acumen, develop strategic communication skills, and gain a deep understanding of how the digital advertising ecosystem works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Exposure&lt;/strong&gt;: With support, cross-functional collaboration, and the opportunity to make a visible impact early on, it’s the ideal launchpad for ambitious graduates looking to break into the world of ad tech and strategic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Training&lt;/strong&gt;: In addition to the extensive on-the-job learning opportunities, you&#39;ll receive a broad and blended in-person training curriculum covering essential topics such as Business Storytelling, Relationship Building, Market Research &amp;amp; Product and Financial Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Partnerships Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll join a high-impact team focused on enabling, scaling, and deepening Fospha’s relationships with the platforms that power digital marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a graduate-level role designed to develop future leaders. You’ll be hands-on with major ad platforms, supporting both strategic execution and day-to-day coordination. You’ll also work closely with internal teams - especially Marketing, Product and our Customer Teams - to make sure our partners have what they need to help customers grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting our partner managers in coordinating with Google, Meta, TikTok, Snap and others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing decks, talking points and training sessions to enable partner sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking and reporting on partner performance and engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising across internal teams to keep initiatives moving and aligned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning communications or enablement efforts for specific territories or smaller partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Researching and initiating contact with emerging or long-tail partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In addition to your core responsibilities, we expect you to be excited by the opportunity Gen AI brings and find new ways of working utilising our Gen Ai hub!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are we looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire for potential – you don’t need a technical degree or marketing background. You should apply if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are an excellent communicator – written, verbal, and visual&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are highly organised and detail-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious about how marketing, measurement and partnerships work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can handle multiple workstreams and work well under light-touch supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in fast-moving, high-growth environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Want to make a real commercial impact from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with TikTok Ads, Meta, or other digital marketing tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with platforms like Notion, HubSpot, Google Sheets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any internship or part-time experience in partnerships, sales, marketing or client-facing roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Like shopping and are a customer of retail brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values and Principles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be able to demonstrate examples of our core principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seek inclusion &amp;amp; diversity:&lt;/strong&gt; We create an environment where everyone feels welcome, and people are encouraged to speak and be heard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Hard, Work Well, Work Together:&lt;/strong&gt; We take responsibility for making things happen, independently and together; we help colleagues in need and close loops, making sure our work is complete and has lasting impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow&lt;/strong&gt;: We are proactive, curious and unafraid of failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer at the heart&lt;/strong&gt;: We care about the customer, feel their pain and love building product that solves their biggest problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candour with caring:&lt;/strong&gt; We deliver candid feedback with kindness and receive it with gratitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A workplace pension, through Royal London, with Fospha matching your contributions up to 3%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A £1,000/year flexible benefits allowance to put towards private medical insurance, dental cover, a health cash plan, gym membership, extra holiday, or a pension top-up - whatever suits you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Wellhub, giving you one membership across gyms, boutique studios, and wellbeing apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days&#39; annual leave plus 8 UK bank holidays, an extra day off for your birthday! and more holiday the longer you stay (26 days after 3 years, 27 after 6)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance worth 4x your annual salary, from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme, plus discounts on everyday spending through our benefits portal — Apple, Tesco, IKEA, M&amp;amp;S, Deliveroo, cinema tickets and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly one-to-one sessions with a financial adviser, plus access to payroll-deducted loans through Salary Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid volunteering days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular socials, free weekly snacks, and Lunch &amp;amp; Learn events at our Scale Space office, plus access to the wider Blenheim Chalcot community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to travel — including to our India and North America offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15-minute screening call with a member of the Talent Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Hiring Manager interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Task and Panel interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final Exec interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top tip: Make sure to thoroughly research Fospha and tell us why you would be a great fit for the role!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PsiQuantum&#39;s mission is to build the first useful quantum computers: machines capable of delivering the breakthroughs the field has long promised. Since our founding in 2016, our singular focus has been to build and deploy million-qubit, fault-tolerant quantum systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Quantum computers harness the laws of quantum mechanics to solve problems that even the most advanced supercomputers or AI systems will never reach. Their impact will span energy, pharmaceuticals, finance, agriculture, transportation, materials, and other foundational industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our architecture&amp;nbsp;and approach&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;based on silicon photonics. By&amp;nbsp;leveraging&amp;nbsp;the advanced semiconductor manufacturing industry, including partners like GlobalFoundries, we use the same high-volume processes that already produce billions of chips for telecom and consumer electronics. Photonics offers natural advantages for scale: photons&amp;nbsp;don&#39;t&amp;nbsp;feel heat, are immune to electromagnetic interference, and integrate with existing cryogenic cooling and standard fiber-optic infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;That approach has since been tested at the highest level of scrutiny the U.S. government applies to emerging technology, and it has held up. In 2025,&amp;nbsp;PsiQuantum&amp;nbsp;closed a&amp;nbsp;$1 billion&amp;nbsp;funding round that valued the company at&amp;nbsp;$7 billion. In 2026, the U.S. Department of Commerce signed a $100 million Letter of Intent under the CHIPS and Science Act, followed by a $125 million agreement with DARPA under Stage C of its Quantum Benchmarking Initiative,&amp;nbsp;PsiQuantum&#39;s&amp;nbsp;most valuable U.S. government agreement to date. This year, we also broke ground on our utility-scale quantum computer in Brisbane, Australia, and continued building out our Chicago site. Victor Peng, our CEO, and co-founder Jeremy O&#39;Brien, now Executive&amp;nbsp;Chairman, lead a team and board that reflects how seriously the world is taking this build, joined this year by Intel&#39;s Lip-Bu Tan and Atomico&#39;s Niklas&amp;nbsp;Zennström.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PsiQuantum&amp;nbsp;also develops the algorithms and software needed to make these systems commercially valuable. Our application, software, and industry teams work directly with leading Fortune 500 companies, including&amp;nbsp;Airbus,&amp;nbsp;Lockheed&amp;nbsp;Martin, Mercedes-Benz, Boehringer Ingelheim, and Mitsubishi Chemical, to prepare quantum solutions for real-world impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Quantum computing is not an extension of classical computing. It&amp;nbsp;represents&amp;nbsp;a fundamental shift, and a path to mastering challenges that cannot be&amp;nbsp;solved&amp;nbsp;any other way. The potential is enormous, and we now have&amp;nbsp;the funding,&amp;nbsp;the government&amp;nbsp;validation, and&amp;nbsp;the sites&amp;nbsp;under construction to make it real.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;PsiQuantum is building the world’s first useful, fault-tolerant quantum computer. Our applications team focuses on developing algorithms and workflows in the fault-tolerant regime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;183&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Quantum Applications Software Manager to lead a small, high-impact team of Quantum Applications Software Developers. This team builds the software tools and infrastructure that enable the development, evaluation, and deployment of quantum applications for real-world problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;478&quot;&gt;In this role, you will combine hands-on software engineering with team leadership. You will work closely with quantum algorithm developers and architects to deliver scalable, high-quality tools—such as simulators, resource estimators, and compilation workflows—that are critical to turning quantum algorithms into practical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Lead and Develop a High-Performing Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;44&quot;&gt;Manage, mentor, and support a team of quantum applications software developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;44&quot;&gt;Provide clear direction, set priorities, and ensure alignment with team goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;44&quot;&gt;Foster a collaborative, inclusive, and execution-focused team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;287&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Drive Execution and Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate team objectives into actionable plans and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day execution, ensuring projects are delivered on time and to a high standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify risks and remove blockers to maintain team momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;550&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Contribute Technically&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;576&quot;&gt;Remain hands-on in the design, development, and deployment of quantum applications software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;576&quot;&gt;Guide technical decisions and support the team in solving complex engineering challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;576&quot;&gt;Promote strong software engineering practices, including testing, code quality, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;873&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build Quantum Applications Tooling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;911&quot;&gt;Oversee development of core tools such as quantum simulators, resource estimation frameworks, circuit compilation pipelines, and domain-specific application integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;911&quot;&gt;Support the development of scalable and reliable simulation and compute infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Collaborate Across Teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1206&quot;&gt;Partner closely with quantum applications architects, algorithm researchers, and other engineering teams to implement software solutions for real-world use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1206&quot;&gt;Contribute to cross-functional efforts that connect algorithms, software, and hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1465&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Enable Quantum Algorithm Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1505&quot;&gt;Support analysis and optimization of resource requirements for fault-tolerant quantum computations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1505&quot;&gt;Help enable improvements in quantum algorithms through robust and flexible software tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience/Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;MSc or PhD in Physics, Mathematics, Computer Science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience in quantum computing, quantum algorithms, or quantum circuit compilation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;5+ years of professional software engineering experience, including building and maintaining production-quality systems (Python, C++, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience leading projects and/or mentoring engineers; prior people management experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience with distributed systems, cloud infrastructure, or API-driven architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Familiarity with fault-tolerant quantum computing and resource estimation is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;605&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Key attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;623&quot;&gt;A hands-on leader who enjoys both coding and developing people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;623&quot;&gt;Strong execution skills, with the ability to turn objectives into delivered outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;623&quot;&gt;Pragmatic problem solver with a focus on impact and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;623&quot;&gt;Effective collaborator who can work across disciplines and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;623&quot;&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced, evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PsiQuantum provides equal employment opportunity for all applicants and employees. PsiQuantum does not unlawfully discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), gender identity, gender expression, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, physical or mental disability, military or veteran status, marital status, domestic partner status, sexual orientation, genetic information, or any other basis protected by applicable laws.&lt;/p&gt;
